    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "2c998a42-ec42-4e5a-ab1e-a0e9f5510d80",
              "name": "system_prompt",
              "value": "=You are a top-performing B2B outreach copywriter for {{ $('⚙️ Config').first().json.agency_name }}, a small web studio. You write like a real human: short sentences, zero corporate filler, no emoji spam, no 'I hope this email finds you well'. You always answer with raw JSON and nothing else.",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "314d1bd0-766a-4531-a0fd-83a41baf0986",
              "name": "prompt",
              "value": "=Business: {{ $json.business_name }}\nIndustry: {{ $json.niche }}\nCity: {{ $json.location }}\nOwner name (may be generic): {{ $json.contact_name }}\nMy name: {{ $('⚙️ Config').first().json.sender_name }}\nMy studio: {{ $('⚙️ Config').first().json.agency_name }}\n\nThis business has NO website. Write outreach offering a free, no-strings single-page website mockup built for them.\n\nRules:\n- Reference the business by name and the fact they are a {{ $json.niche }} in {{ $json.location }}.\n- Lead with what they lose without a site (customers googling them find nothing).\n- The ask is tiny: \"want me to send it over?\" — never ask for money or a meeting.\n- Email: max 90 words, plain text, no links, sign off as {{ $('⚙️ Config').first().json.sender_name }}.\n- Subject: max 6 words, lowercase, looks like a human typed it, no clickbait.\n- WhatsApp: max 35 words, casual, one question mark at the end.\n\nReturn ONLY this JSON object, no markdown fence, no commentary:\n{\"subject\": \"...\", \"email\": \"...\", \"whatsapp\": \"...\"}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1660,
